{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSAZKhH6vPXUh9Ppywmy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` to the registration and offers screens. Every event goes through `Analytics.capture`. `flutter analyze` reports no issues, but I didn't run the app, so I haven't confirmed that events actually reach PostHog. The full write-up is in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**Registration screen** (`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`):\n- **`registration_email_started` / `registration_phone_started`:** sent once per screen visit, on the first character typed in the field.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`:** sent when the user lets go of the slider (`onChangeEnd`), with `amount` as an int.\n- **`terms_accepted`:** sent only when the box is ticked; unticking sends nothing.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`:** sent on the Continue tap, before moving to the offers screen, with `amount` (int) and `terms` (bool).\n\n**Offers screen** (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`): I turned it into a `StatefulWidget`. `offers_scrolled` is sent when a scroll ends, and only if the user got further down than any offset already sent. `offset` is that point, as a double.\n\n**Decision for you:** the spec doesn't say how often the slider and scroll events should fire. Sent on every change, they'd produce dozens of events per second and burn through the free-tier PostHog limit. So I chose one event per drag on the slider, and one per scroll that reaches a new depth on the offers list. If you'd rather count every scroll, change the condition in `_onScroll`.\n\nThe email and phone number are never sent: their events have no properties, and the Continue event carries only `amount` and `terms`.\n\n`flutter pub get` modified `analysis_options.yaml` on its own. I reverted that and deleted `.dart_tool/` and `pubspec.lock`, so the diff touches only the two screens plus the new `ANSWER.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1177,"cache_read_input_tokens":29913,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1177},"output_tokens":640,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"259bff40-9e26-47a6-9194-589958aba7fb","uuid":"dd77838f-6937-48a8-9d81-107fb7e5f95b","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:10:12.078Z","request_id":"req_011CgSAZKReejcGfrvimFzT2"}
